[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17220.39, "timestamp": "04:47:00", "text": "神话般的是生病了。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17223.35, "timestamp": "04:47:03", "text": "是的。时间也已经很晚了。现在我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17225.43, "timestamp": "04:47:05", "text": "我也想知道，就像你做……的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17228.55, "timestamp": "04:47:08", "text": "晚上直播，对吧，我们大多数人都是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17231.75, "timestamp": "04:47:11", "text": "会非常累之类的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17234.15, "timestamp": "04:47:14", "text": "是的。我也收到了。我不能责怪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17235.86, "timestamp": "04:47:15", "text": "不过她呢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17237.35, "timestamp": "04:47:17", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17245.19, "timestamp": "04:47:25", "text": "我实际上克服了疲劳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17247.35, "timestamp": "04:47:27", "text": "洗澡时把头埋进……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17250.03, "timestamp": "04:47:30", "text": "几个桶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17253.43, "timestamp": "04:47:33", "text": "分钟。我自己也感到抱歉。溺水了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17257.19, "timestamp": "04:47:37", "text": "你自己。没关系。我的天啊。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17259.99, "timestamp": "04:47:39", "text": "是的。不过不要经常这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17262.03, "timestamp": "04:47:42", "text": "不，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17265.59, "timestamp": "04:47:45", "text": "不。就像那种浴缸一样的东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17268.47, "timestamp": "04:47:48", "text": "好的，那很好。但既然如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17270.788, "timestamp": "04:47:50", "text": "不是那种浴缸之类的东西，它是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17276.15, "timestamp": "04:47:56", "text": "所以你喜欢把你的东西放在一个狭窄的地方"}]